WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.181 --> 00:00:04.348
(bouncy, energetic Georgian folk music)

00:00:17.862 --> 00:00:20.945
(bouncy piano music)

00:00:29.265 --> 00:00:31.158
- [Narrator] Georgian
National Dance is a folk dance

00:00:31.158 --> 00:00:33.369
comprised of strong, athletic movements

00:00:33.369 --> 00:00:36.101
from the male dancers and
floating, effortless movements

00:00:36.101 --> 00:00:38.122
from the females.

00:00:38.122 --> 00:00:41.010
The unique choreography combines
folk with classical ballet

00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:43.580
and modern dance, and the company’s best

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:45.750
are part of Georgia's
original professional

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:48.256
dance company, Sukhishvili.

00:00:48.256 --> 00:00:52.397
- Our dance company
exists more than 70 years

00:00:52.397 --> 00:00:56.992
and my grandparents
created this dance company.

00:00:56.992 --> 00:00:59.434
It was wholly due to them
that the Georgian dance

00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:02.101
became so popular in my country.

00:01:03.655 --> 00:01:07.260
Now our dance company
is more than 100 dancers

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:09.248
and a live band.

00:01:09.248 --> 00:01:11.009
- [Narrator] The company has
traveled around the world,

00:01:11.009 --> 00:01:13.299
and since it's creation,
has performed in front of

00:01:13.299 --> 00:01:15.216
over 50 million people.

00:01:16.355 --> 00:01:18.382
But preparing to take
the stage takes years

00:01:18.382 --> 00:01:20.610
of rehearsed practice.

00:01:20.610 --> 00:01:22.593
- [Nino] They need a lot of training,

00:01:22.593 --> 00:01:25.252
because we perform very difficult dances

00:01:25.252 --> 00:01:27.873
and complicated movements.

00:01:27.873 --> 00:01:30.953
We dance on the toes and
they have nothing inside.

00:01:30.953 --> 00:01:33.536
It's like a thin leather boot.

00:01:49.684 --> 00:01:52.927
- [Nino] We use daggers and
swords through the dancings

00:01:52.927 --> 00:01:56.697
and they need to have
a good fighting skills.

00:01:56.697 --> 00:01:59.079
- [Narrator] To be a Sukhishvili
dancer is a huge honor

00:01:59.079 --> 00:02:02.311
in Georgia, and with a
school of over 3,000 dancers

00:02:02.311 --> 00:02:04.612
in training, the future
of traditional Georgian

00:02:04.612 --> 00:02:06.732
folk dance is bright.

00:02:06.732 --> 00:02:10.561
- I hope that Georgian dance
will be popular always,

00:02:10.561 --> 00:02:13.699
because it's very patriotic.

00:02:13.699 --> 00:02:15.759
We do our job with a great love.

00:02:15.759 --> 00:02:18.342
We dedicated our lives to this.

00:02:22.733 --> 00:02:24.900
(chiming)

